<https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/r2bo/CapabilityStatement/r2bo-minsal-consumidor> a fhir:CapabilityStatement ;
  fhir:nodeRole fhir:treeRoot ;
  fhir:Resource.id [ fhir:value "r2bo-minsal-consumidor"] ;
  fhir:DomainResource.text [
     fhir:Narrative.status [ fhir:value "extensions" ] ;
     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: CapabilityStatement r2bo-minsal-consumidor</b></p><a name=\"r2bo-minsal-consumidor\"> </a><a name=\"hcr2bo-minsal-consumidor\"> </a><h2 id=\"title\">CapabilityStatement Consumidor del Repositorio de Biopsia del Ministerio de Salud</h2><ul><li>Implementation Guide Version: 0.3.1-draft </li><li>FHIR Version: 4.0.1 </li><li>Supported Formats: <code>json</code>, <code>xml</code>, <code>application/fhir+json</code>, <code>application/fhir+xml</code></li><li>Published on: 2025-03-05 15:30:00-0300 </li><li>Published by: Unidad de Interoperabilidad - MINSAL </li></ul><blockquote class=\"impl-note\"><p><strong>Note to Implementers: FHIR Capabilities</strong></p><p>Any FHIR capability may be 'allowed' by the system unless explicitly marked as 'SHALL NOT'. A few items are marked as MAY in the Implementation Guide to highlight their potential relevance to the use case.</p></blockquote><p>This CapabilityStatement imports these CapabilityStatements <a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/nid/0.4.9/CapabilityStatement-NID.IHE.HPD.Consumer.html\">Consumidor del Directorio de Proveedores de Atención Médica</a>, <a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/nid/0.4.9/CapabilityStatement-MPI.IHE.PDQm.Search.Cliente.html\">Indice Maestro Paciente: \"Cliente Buscador de Datos Demográficos (PDQm)\"</a></p><h3 id=\"shallIGs\">SHALL Support the Following Implementation Guides</h3><ul><li><a href=\"https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/1.9.4/index.html\">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/ImplementationGuide/hl7.fhir.cl.clcore</a></li><li><a href=\"https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/nid/0.4.9/index.html\">https://interoperabilidad.minsal.cl/fhir/ig/nid/ImplementationGuide/hl7.fhir.cl.minsal.nid</a></li><li><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/us/mcode/STU4/index.html\">http://hl7.org/fhir/us/mcode/ImplementationGuide/hl7.fhir.us.mcode</a></li></ul><h2 id=\"rest\">FHIR RESTful Capabilities</h2><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h3 id=\"mode1\" class=\"panel-title\">Mode: <code>client</code></h3></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div><p>Este Cliente del Repositorio de Biopsia del Ministerio de Salud permite la busqueda de informes de anatomía patológica y sus resultados.</p>\n</div><div class=\"lead\"><em>Security</em></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\">Enable CORS: no</div><div class=\"col-lg-6\">Security services supported: <code>OAuth</code></div></div><blockquote><div><p>OAuth2 usando el APIG del Ministerio de Salud para generar Tokens para enviar y acceder al respositorio</p>\n</div></blockquote><div class=\"lead\"><em>Summary of System-wide Interactions</em></div><ul><li>Supports the <code>search-system</code>interaction described as follows:<div><p>Iteracción para realizar busquedas de un informe de biopsia y sus resultados</p>\n</div></li></ul><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Summary of System-wide Operations</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Operation</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>$graphql</td><td><div><p>Operación para extraer los datos del repositorio de biopsia en formato GraphQL</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div><h3 id=\"resourcesCap1\">Capabilities by Resource/Profile</h3><h4 id=\"resourcesSummary1\">Summary</h4><p>The summary table lists the resources that are part of this configuration, and for each resource it lists:</p><ul><li>The relevant profiles (if any)</li><li>The interactions supported by each resource (<b><span class=\"bg-info\">R</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">S</span></b>earch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">U</span></b>pdate, and <b><span class=\"bg-info\">C</span></b>reate, are always shown, while <b><span class=\"bg-info\">VR</span></b>ead, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">P</span></b>atch, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">D</span></b>elete, <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">I</span></b>nstance, or <b><span class=\"bg-info\">H</span></b>istory on <b><span class=\"bg-info\">T</span></b>ype are only present if at least one of the resources has support for them.</li><li><span>The required, recommended, and some optional search parameters (if any). </span></li><li>The linked resources enabled for <code>_include</code></li><li>The other resources enabled for <code>_revinclude</code></li><li>The operations on the resource (if any)</li></ul><div class=\"table-responsive\"><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th><b>Resource Type</b></th><th><b>Profile</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET a resource (read interaction)\">R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET past versions of resources (vread interaction)\">V-R</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"GET all set of resources of the type (search interaction)\">S</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"PUT a new resource version (update interaction)\">U</b></th><th class=\"text-center\"><b title=\"POST a new resource (create interaction)\">C</b></th><th><b title=\"Required and recommended search parameters\">Searches</b></th><th><code><b>_include</b></code></th><th><code><b>_revinclude</b></code></th><th><b>Operations</b></th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><a href=\"#DiagnosticReport1-1\">DiagnosticReport</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-informe-biopsia.html\">Perfil del Reporte de Anatomía Patológica</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>code, subject, conclusion, result, based-on, patient, specimen, issued, identifier, performer, _id, category, status</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:based-on</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:patient</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:performer</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:result</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:specimen</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:subject</code></td><td><code>Observation:focus</code></td><td><code>$graphql</code></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Observation1-2\">Observation</a></td><td><a href=\"https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/1.9.4/StructureDefinition-CoreObservacionCL.html\">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/StructureDefinition/CoreObservacionCL</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-estadificacion-tnm.html\">Perfil de Grupo Estadificación TNM</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-categoria-tnm.html\">Perfil de Origen para las Categorías T, N,  M (Abstracto)</a><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-resultados-reporte-biopsia.html\">Perfil de Para Todas las Observaciones de los Resultados de Biopsias</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>date, subject, value-concept, focus, has-member, component-code-value-quantity, code-value-quantity, combo-code-value-concept, value-string, identifier, method, value-quantity, combo-value-quantity, code-value-concept, _id, status, combo-data-absent-reason, code, component-data-absent-reason, combo-code-value-quantity, code-value-string, based-on, patient, specimen, component-code, performer, combo-code, component-value-quantity, data-absent-reason, component-code-value-concept, component-value-concept, category, combo-value-concept</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>Observation:based-on</code>, <code>Observation:derived-from</code>, <code>Observation:device</code>, <code>Observation:encounter</code>, <code>Observation:focus</code>, <code>Observation:has-member</code>, <code>Observation:part-of</code>, <code>Observation:patient</code>, <code>Observation:performer</code>, <code>Observation:specimen</code>, <code>Observation:subject</code></td><td><code>DiagnosticReport:result</code>, <code>Observation:derived-from</code>, <code>Observation:focus</code>, <code>Observation:has-member</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#PractitionerRole1-3\">PractitionerRole</a></td><td><a href=\"https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/1.9.4/StructureDefinition-CoreRolClinicoCl.html\">https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/StructureDefinition/CoreRolClinicoCl</a><br/><em>Additional supported profiles:</em><br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-rol-profesional-minsal.html\">Perfil de Rol Profesional</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>role, practitioner, organization</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:endpoint</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:location</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:organization</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:practitioner</code>, <code>PractitionerRole:service</code></td><td><code>DiagnosticReport:performer</code>, <code>DiagnosticReport:results-interpreter</code>, <code>Observation:focus</code>, <code>Observation:performer</code>, <code>Patient:general-practitioner</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:performer</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:requester</code>, <code>Specimen:collector</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#ServiceRequest1-4\">ServiceRequest</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-solicitud-informe-apa.html\">Perfil de Solicitud de Informe de Anatomía Patológica</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>code, subject, patient, specimen, requester, identifier, performer, intent, performer-type, category, status</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:based-on</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:patient</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:performer</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:requester</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:specimen</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:subject</code></td><td><code>DiagnosticReport:based-on</code>, <code>Observation:based-on</code>, <code>Observation:focus</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:based-on</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:replaces</code></td><td/></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#Specimen1-5\">Specimen</a></td><td>Supported Profiles<br/>  <a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-muestra-biopsia.html\">Perfil de Muestra</a></td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\">y</td><td class=\"text-center\"/><td class=\"text-center\"/><td>identifier, bodysite, subject, collected, type, collector, patient, status</td><td><code>*</code>, <code>Specimen:collector</code>, <code>Specimen:parent</code>, <code>Specimen:patient</code>, <code>Specimen:subject</code></td><td><code>DiagnosticReport:specimen</code>, <code>Observation:focus</code>, <code>Observation:specimen</code>, <code>ServiceRequest:specimen</code>, <code>Specimen:parent</code></td><td/></tr></tbody></table></div><hr/><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"DiagnosticReport1-1\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: SHALL </span>DiagnosticReport</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Core FHIR Resource</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html\">DiagnosticReport</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code>, <code>logical</code></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>search-type</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>vread</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-informe-biopsia.html\">Perfil del Reporte de Anatomía Patológica</a></p></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Código de identificación del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">subject</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El sujeto del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">conclusion</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Código de conclusión (interpretación/impresión) del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">result</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Enlace de la observaciones de los resultados</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">based-on</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Solicitud del Informe de Anatomia Patológica</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Paciente asociado al informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">specimen</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Detalles del Especimen</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">issued</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Cuando fue creado el informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">identifier</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Identificador del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">performer</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Quien es el responsable del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/resource.html#search\">_id</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Id logico dentro del servidor del informe</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">category</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Cual es la categoria del informe, por defecto es PAT</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/diagnosticreport.html#search\">status</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El estado del Reporte</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-12\"><span class=\"lead\">Extended Operations</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Operation</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td>$graphql</td><td><div><p>Operación para extraer los datos del repositorio de biopsia en formato GraphQL</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"Observation1-2\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: SHALL </span>Observation</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/1.9.4/StructureDefinition-CoreObservacionCL.html\">CL Observación</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code>, <code>logical</code></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-estadificacion-tnm.html\">Perfil de Grupo Estadificación TNM</a><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-categoria-tnm.html\">Perfil de Origen para las Categorías T, N,  M (Abstracto)</a><br/><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-resultados-reporte-biopsia.html\">Perfil de Para Todas las Observaciones de los Resultados de Biopsias</a></p></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>search-type</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>vread</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">date</a></td><td><code>date</code></td><td><div><p>Fecha de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">subject</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El sujeto de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">value-concept</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El valor de la observación, si el valor es un concepto codificado</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">focus</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El objeto de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">has-member</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Recursos relacionados son miembros de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-code-value-quantity</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par entre el código del componente y el valor de la cantidad del componente</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">code-value-quantity</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par entre el código y el valor de la cantidad</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-code-value-concept</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par en el parametro de código y valor codificado, incluyendo en componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">value-string</a></td><td><code>string</code></td><td><div><p>El valor de la observación, si el valor es un string, y también busca en CodeableConcept.text</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">identifier</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Identificador único de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">method</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El método usado para la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">value-quantity</a></td><td><code>quantity</code></td><td><div><p>El valor de la observación, si el valor es una cantidad, o un SampledData (solo busca en los límites de los valores en los datos muestreados)</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-value-quantity</a></td><td><code>quantity</code></td><td><div><p>El valor o el valor del componente de la observación, si el valor es una cantidad, o un SampledData (solo busca en los límites de los valores en los datos muestreados)</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">code-value-concept</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par en el parametro de código y valor codificado</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/resource.html#search\">_id</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Id lógico del recurso</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">status</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El estado de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-data-absent-reason</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>La razón por la que el valor esperado en el elemento Observation.component.value[x] está ausente</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El código de identificación de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-data-absent-reason</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>La razón por la que el valor esperado en el elemento Observation.component.value[x] está ausente</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-code-value-quantity</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par en el parametro de código y valor codificado, incluyendo en componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">code-value-string</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par en el parametro de código y valor codificado, incluyendo en componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">based-on</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Recurso que origina la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El paciente asociado a la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">specimen</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El especimen asociado a la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El código del componente de la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">performer</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El individuo u organización que realizó la observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El código de la observación, incluyendo en componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-value-quantity</a></td><td><code>quantity</code></td><td><div><p>El valor del componente de la observación, si el valor es una cantidad, o un SampledData (solo busca en los límites de los valores en los datos muestreados)</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">data-absent-reason</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>La razón de por qué el valor esperado en el elemento Observation.value[x] está ausente</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-code-value-concept</a></td><td><code>composite</code></td><td><div><p>Par en el parametro de código y valor codificado de los componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">component-value-concept</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El valor del componente de la observación, si el valor es un concepto codificado</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">category</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>La clasificación del tipo de observación</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/observation.html#search\">combo-value-concept</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El valor de la observación, si el valor es un concepto codificado, incluyendo en componentes</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"PractitionerRole1-3\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: SHALL </span>PractitionerRole</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Base System Profile</span><br/><a href=\"https://hl7chile.cl/fhir/ig/clcore/1.9.4/StructureDefinition-CoreRolClinicoCl.html\">CL RolClinico</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Profile Conformance</span><br/><b>SHALL</b></div><div class=\"col-lg-3\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code>, <code>logical</code></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-rol-profesional-minsal.html\">Perfil de Rol Profesional</a></p></div><div class=\"col-lg-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>search-type</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>vread</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitionerrole.html#search\">role</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>El rol que cumple el profesional en el establecimiento de salud</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitionerrole.html#search\">practitioner</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>El profesional que cumple el rol</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/practitionerrole.html#search\">organization</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>La identidad de la organización que representa el profesional</p>\n</div></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"col-lg-5\"> </div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"panel panel-default\"><div class=\"panel-heading\"><h4 id=\"ServiceRequest1-4\" class=\"panel-title\"><span style=\"float: right;\">Resource Conformance: SHALL </span>ServiceRequest</h4></div><div class=\"panel-body\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Core FHIR Resource</span><br/><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html\">ServiceRequest</a></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Reference Policy</span><br/><code>literal</code>, <code>logical</code></div><div class=\"col-lg-4\"><span class=\"lead\">Interaction summary</span><br/><ul><li>Supports <code>search-type</code>, <code>read</code>, <code>vread</code>.</li></ul></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-6\"><span class=\"lead\">Supported Profiles</span><p><a href=\"StructureDefinition-r2bo-solicitud-informe-apa.html\">Perfil de Solicitud de Informe de Anatomía Patológica</a></p></div></div><p/><div class=\"row\"><div class=\"col-lg-7\"><span class=\"lead\">Search Parameters</span><table class=\"table table-condensed table-hover\"><thead><tr><th>Conformance</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Type</th><th>Documentation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">code</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Código de solicitud</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">subject</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Búsqueda por sujeto</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">patient</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Paciente asociado a la solicitud</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">specimen</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Muestra que sera analizada</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">requester</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Quien solicita el servicio</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">identifier</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>Identificador único de la solicitud</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">performer</a></td><td><code>reference</code></td><td><div><p>Responsable de realizar el servicio</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">intent</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>proposal | plan | directive | order | original-order | reflex-order | filler-order | instance-order | option</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b>SHALL</b></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/servicerequest.html#search\">performer-type</a></td><td><code>token</code></td><td><div><p>